      "css": {
        "@layer base": {
          "*": {
            "@apply border-border outline-ring/50": {}
          },
          "body": {
            "@apply bg-background text-foreground": {}
          },
          "html": {
            "@apply font-sans": {}
          },
          "@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)": {
            "*, ::before, ::after": {
              "animation-duration": "0.01ms !important",
              "animation-iteration-count": "1 !important",
              "transition-duration": "0.01ms !important",
              "scroll-behavior": "auto !important"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "docs": "Dark mode is class-based: add `dark` to `<html>`, for example with next-themes (not installed by this item). `@layer base` ships a `prefers-reduced-motion` guard that collapses every animation and transition. The cssVars are generated from the registry's app/globals.css; do not edit them by hand."
